# Intentionally empty.
#
# uwsm only sources this file in a uwsm-managed session. gdm also offers the
# plain sway.desktop entry, and on that one everything here was silently
# unset - which is how NVIDIA VA-API decode and the toolkit backends ended up
# inert without any visible failure.
#
# The whole set therefore moved to ~/.config/environment.d/ (sway.conf,
# nvidia.conf), which `systemd --user` reads in BOTH session types. Add new
# session variables there, not here.
